#AREADATA
Name        { 1 99} Blah    Malokteri Headquarters~
Builders    None~
VNUMs       9500 9517
Security    1
Recall      3001
End



#HELPS

0 VALHERU~
Long ago, the world was rules by the Valheru.  They were an ancient
race, able to fly across the skies on the backs of mighty dragons.  Their
lives were ruled by the gods of chaos and destruction.  They cared not 
for the lives of their mortal servants, using them as play things and
killing them in their insane rage.  No one could stand up to the Valheru,
their combined might was unrivaled.  They destroyed any who were
foolish enough to stand in their path, until the day when they saw there
was no one left to destroy.  They turned their gaze upwards, to the
heavens.  So great was their power, they sought to challenge the gods.
It would bring about their death.  While their power was immense it
wasn't enough for this battle.  The Valheru were destroyed, all save
one.  Only one had been wise enough to know their own limits.  He
was the oldest Valheru, Ashen Shugar.  He ruled the land for many
generations, until one day he too passed from this earth.

That was many generations ago, and once again the Valheru are united.
They are all the descendants of Ashen Shugar, and his blood flow within
their veins.  While they are only mere mortals now, they conquer and rule
through strength of arms.  Their goal is to once again have the world
kneel and beg before the Valheru.

The Valheru has three important ranks.  They are lead by Boldar who is 
a direct descendant of Ashen Shugar.  Kyriel and Ingen serve as his left
and right hand, the Dragon Lords of the clan.  Everyone else works their
way up to the rank of Dragon Rider where they can serve as warriors for
the Valheru.

There are no requirements to join Valheru.  Players are recruited, not
their statistics.  Generally in order to join the Valheru the three leaders
must all agree that the applicant would make the clan stronger.  If even
one disagrees, you won't be joined to the clan.  If you wish to join the
try to impress us with your skills in combat.  Thats the only way to join
the Valheru.
~

0 $~

#MOBILES
#9500
urbat guardian~
Urbat~
Urbat viscously stands guard, lingering for flesh
~
Urbat viscously stands guard, lingering for flesh
~
2147 65704 0 S
96 0 0 0d0+0 0d0+0
0 0
0 0 1
>speech_prog gate danger law guard trouble city recall~
if rand(14)
mpecho $I says 'Keep your weapon down unless you want the street to remember you poorly.'
else
if rand(17)
mpecho $I says 'If you get lost, recall. If recall fails, you picked the wrong room or the wrong curse.'
else
if rand(20)
mpecho $I says 'Gates let trouble in. I'm the part that decides how it leaves.'
else
if rand(25)
mpecho $I says 'I've stood at this post so long I've named the cracks in the wall. That one's Gerald. Don't touch Gerald.'
else
if rand(33)
mpecho $I says 'Crime's down this month. Mostly because the criminals keep wandering into things with teeth.'
else
if rand(50)
mpecho $I says 'You look suspicious. Everyone looks suspicious. That's the job. Move along.'
else
mpecho $I adjusts a halberd that has clearly never needed sharpening and never will.
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
endif
~
|
