#ROOMDATA
#9500
The Vestibule~
This vestibule is perfectly circular, with four marble columns supporting the arched
ceiling high above your head.  The floor here is made of perfect, veinless white
marble and inlaid with obsidian rings, forming a pattern of concentric circles on the
floor.  A set of stairs directly aligned lead both upwards and downwards extending
from the vestibule.
~
