#9501
The Avenue of the Malokteri~
This wide road is decorated on both sides by huge life-like statues of the gods and
goddesses of the Malokteri. The cobblestones beneath your feet are old and worn,
but well tended.  To the south, you see the archway of the kingdom's entrance.  To
the north is nothing but glowing candles that set the corridors ablaze in a hypnotic
fashion.
~
