#9507
The Alleyway~
As you move away from the main avenue, the stone floor gets horribly mucky, sticking to
your shoes and emitting a most undesirable smell. There is nothing much else here, but
piles upon piles of trash. A few rats scatter here and there, but the main occupants of this
particular alley are the shadows.
~
