#9509
A second story shop~
You climb the stairs on the outside of a large two-story building.  As you reach the top, you
walk through an open doorway.  All around are shelves of various devices and gadgets neatly
priced.  Ahead of you is a white granite counter.  Behind the counter stands a tall, dark, shady
man.
~
